00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Don't type your notes. Tell your agent to take them.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,971
The note comes back as a chip. Click it — and you're there. Created, filed, and linked.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,001
Pinned, tagged, searchable — in your own database, on your own hardware.

4
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,083
That's Notes. Full tour on our channel.
